namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamLyricsView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Lyrics/DreamLyricsView.h#DreamLyricsView
    src   "An Apple Music-style lyric view: one text line per lyric line, the current line held at a fixed\nheight while the others glide above and below it on springs; words light up as they are sung\nthrough the text's fill channels; lines further from the current one soften and fade.\n\nPut it on a widget that is the view's frame (its width wraps the lines, its height is the visible\narea). Give it lyrics with SetLyrics and drive it with SetTime from your audio clock -- or\nPlay() to let it run on its own for previews."
    text  "Apple Music 风格的歌词视图：每行歌词对应一个文本行，当前行保持在固定\n高度，其他行则通过弹簧在其上下滑动；演唱时文字通过文本的填充通道逐字\n点亮；距离当前行越远的行越柔和、越淡。\n\n将其放在作为视图框架的控件上（其宽度包裹各行，其高度为可见\n区域）。用 SetLyrics 为其提供歌词，并用音频时钟的 SetTime 驱动它——或\n调用 Play() 让它在预览时自行运行。"
    state machine
}

